From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:36:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): a route the policy refuses cannot block
 switching away from it [daveey]

_current_route already lets a pick leave a route that cannot authenticate, but a ModelRoutingError
from the same resolution escaped and crashed session.mutate, so Desktop showed "Model switch failed:
internal error" on the one action that recovers the chat. d464e6a60e cleared the adopted-chat cause;
any other refusal (a pin the registry rejects, a real endpoint override) still hit this crash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
